  (descr "CLASS A [EIA] chip land pair, 0402 (1005Metric). EIA case-size nominal body. 0201 = 0.60 x 0.30 mm, 0402 = 1.00 x 0.50 mm. Land = band + toe 0.15 + heel 0.10 long, body + 2 x side 0.05 wide. Fillet allowances are a CHOICE of this lane, not a citation. No part on Apple's board was measured to produce this pattern; it is here because the Replica's discretes are 0201/0402 and a library needs the pattern before a placement can use it.")
